			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"蘭茶荼",
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730200101,
					"content": "嗚噢？嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200102,
					"content": "啊。是那菈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200103,
					"content": "咳咳。讓那菈目睹我狼狽的模樣，真是十分羞愧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200104,
					"content": "善良的那菈，我是蘭茶荼。兩位是？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200105,
					"content": "#我叫{NICKNAME}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200106,
					"content": "我叫派蒙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200107,
					"content": "#那菈{NICKNAME}和派蒙，我明白了。真是十分感謝。倘若不是在這裡與{F#妳}{M#你}們有緣相遇，要恢復還得花上一點時間。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200108,
					"content": "一點時間是多久啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200109,
					"content": "實在慚愧，以前也因為不好的蘑菇，遇到過類似的情況。後來，水中的月蓮綻開又合上，重複了兩次，我就恢復了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200110,
					"content": "綻開又合上…那不是要花兩天時間嗎！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200111,
					"content": "#啊，兩天。原來如此，原來這就是「天」的意思。{F#妳}{M#你}們那菈真好玩。兩天算是長還是短呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200112,
					"content": "#嗯…{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}覺得呢？兩天算長還是短？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200113,
						730200116,
						730200120,
						730200123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200113,
					"content": "算是長吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200114,
					"content": "嗯嗯。很難想像蘭茶荼「嗚噢噢噢噢」整整兩天呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200115,
					"content": "是嗎？原來這樣算很長時間啊，不得了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200126,
					"content": "不過，這麼說來，你叫蘭茶荼的話…是蘭帕卡提的親人嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200127,
					"content": "不是。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200128,
					"content": "欸？但是…你是蘭帕卡提的哥哥？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200129,
					"content": "咦，你們怎麼知道？蘭帕卡提是我的「妹妹」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200130,
					"content": "到底是怎麼回事啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200131,
					"content": "可能蘭那羅的概念不同…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200132
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200132,
					"content": "總之，事情是這樣的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200133,
					"content": "向蘭茶荼述說事情的經過。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200134
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200134,
					"content": "無憂節又要舉辦了嗎…該怎麼辦呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200135,
					"content": "我還沒有準備好重要的「食材」，在無憂節向蘭薩卡、蘭阿帕斯、蘭非拉證明，蘑菇菜餚才是最好的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200136,
					"content": "這麼說來，蘭斯…斯帕…蘭…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200137,
					"content": "蘭薩卡、蘭阿帕斯、蘭非拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200138
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200138,
					"content": "啊啊啊！蘭那羅的名字好難記喔！蘭茶荼，你的兄弟到哪去了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200139,
					"content": "我們在各自修行的道路上漸行漸遠。就像河流變成溪流。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200140,
					"content": "也就是分散了，對吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200141,
					"content": "我們「烹飪修行」是為了做出「至上珍饈」，可是他們竟然不承認蘑菇菜餚。明明「一頭菇」無可匹敵。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200142
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200142,
					"content": "總之，我們決定完成各自的菜餚，等完成後再比較。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200143
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200143,
					"content": "原來是這樣。既然是對美食的追求，那就完全可以理解！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200144
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200144,
					"content": "那麼，你的「一頭菇」呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200145
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200145,
					"content": "近來「無留陀」的蔓生頻繁，「一頭菇」所生長的環境也被佔據了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200146,
					"content": "啊，也就是死域…希望拉娜一切安好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200147
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200147,
					"content": "珍貴的蘑菇恐怕也被枯萎的爪牙刨走。想必兩位也明白，「無留陀」之地兇險非常，非常兇險。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200148
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200148,
					"content": "沒有「一頭菇」，就嘗試了不曾有蘭那羅吃過的怪怪蘑菇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200149
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200149,
					"content": "結果呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200150,
						730200151
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200150,
					"content": "結果就是我們看到的樣子吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200152
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200152,
					"content": "實在是不好意思。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200153
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200153,
					"content": "不過這麼說來，死域…也就是「無留陀」，我們之前也對付過吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200154,
						730200155
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200154,
					"content": "輕輕鬆鬆。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200156
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200156,
					"content": "#喔，真是不可思議。{F#妳}{M#你}們居然有與「無留陀」抗衡的力量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200157
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200157,
					"content": "#不過這樣就說得通了。既然那菈{NICKNAME}能使用草王的力量治癒我，那消除「無留陀」的影響想來也不是問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200158
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200158,
					"content": "#那麼，我想請求那菈{NICKNAME}隨我一同，深入「一頭菇」生長的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200159
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200159,
					"content": "#是品嚐美味無比的蘑菇菜餚的機會！{NICKNAME}，為了讓他們兄妹團聚，我們就幫幫忙吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200160,
						730200161
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200160,
					"content": "好。反正本來也答應了蘭帕卡提。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200163
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200163,
					"content": "好。就在前方的洞窟裡。請陪我一起去看看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200161,
					"content": "妳只是想吃吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200162
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200162,
					"content": "一舉兩得，有什麼不對嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200163
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200155,
					"content": "勉勉強強。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200156
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200151,
					"content": "「嗚噢噢噢噢——！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200152
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200116,
					"content": "算是短吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200117,
					"content": "唔…確實，這麼想來，我們已經認識了這麼久。但感覺就像昨天一樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200118,
					"content": "是嗎？那我就放心了。在森林裡失控兩天原來也不算太長時間。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200119,
					"content": "倒不是這個意思啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200120,
					"content": "取決於這個時間用來幹什麼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200121
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200121,
					"content": "嗯，確實呢。如果「嗚噢噢噢噢」整整兩天，就是很長時間。如果是野林豬從小長大，就是很短時間。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200122,
					"content": "是嗎？原來這樣算很長時間啊，不得了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200123,
					"content": "時間是主觀概念，沒有意義。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200124,
					"content": "#嗯。那菈{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}很明白森林的道理。對於森林來說，生命誕生、生命成長、生命回歸土地，都不需要「天」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200125,
					"content": "什麼亂七八糟的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7302002,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7302005
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7302005",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7302005,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"蘭茶荼",
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730200201,
					"content": "啊啊，我朝思暮想的「一頭菇」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200202,
					"content": "「一頭菇」，倘若你失去了你的芬芳，你還會是「一頭菇」嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200203,
					"content": "嘿嘿，蘑菇。聞起來確實很不錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200204,
					"content": "不管怎麼說，我們出去吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7302003,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7302010
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7302010",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7302010,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"蘭茶荼",
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730200301,
					"content": "#能遇到{F#妳}{M#你}們，真是一件幸事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200302,
					"content": "這是完全成熟的「一頭菇」的味道，比起上次我聞到的更醇厚了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200303,
					"content": "看來即使生長之處被「無留陀」佔據，你也好好成長了，真是了不起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200304,
					"content": "嗯，那個，「一頭菇」…能讓我們嚐嚐嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200305,
					"content": "當然。且不論兩位有恩於我，再一次用最美味的蘑菇菜餚招待那菈本來就是我「烹飪修行」的目標。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200306,
					"content": "好耶！一頭菇！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200307,
					"content": "蘭茶荼立刻開始烹飪…\\n蘑菇鮮香的風味自鍋中滿溢而出。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200308,
					"content": "#隨後，蘭茶荼將成品交給{F#妳}{M#你}與派蒙。\\n…應該說是令人失望還是符合預期呢，並沒有什麼滋味。\\n而且充滿了強大的生命力，組織實在太過堅韌，難以嚼碎。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200309
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200309,
					"content": "…完成了。我的「烹飪修行」，已經抵達了完滿的終點。如何？對於那菈來說，想必是最好的美味吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200310,
					"content": "嚼嚼…咕嚕…唔…該怎麼說呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200311,
					"content": "（用力咀嚼）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200312
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200312,
					"content": "（用力吞咽）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200313,
						730200314,
						730200315
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200313,
					"content": "算是可以吃。夠努力的話。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200316
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200316,
					"content": "嗯…確實是很香的蘑菇呢，不過味道和口感不太適合我們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200317,
					"content": "欸？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200318,
					"content": "#怎麼會這樣呢，之前同樣做給那菈吃的時候，{MATEAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_HE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SHE]}明明說好吃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200319,
					"content": "之前？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200320,
					"content": "#以前，我也做過蘑菇菜餚給那菈吃。而且因為好吃，{MATEAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_HE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SHE]}咽下去的時候還特別用力。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200321,
					"content": "應該沒有問題才對。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200322,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200323,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200324
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200324,
					"content": "唉。就像不同的蘭那羅，會長出不同的葉子。蘑菇的滋味，或許也不一定適合所有那菈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200325,
					"content": "是啦，不過說起葉子…你們蘭那羅難道不怕火嗎，明明自己看起來也有很多葉子一樣的構造…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200326,
					"content": "火當然是可怕的，有時森林中燃起的山火，會將一整座山頭化為荒地…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200327,
					"content": "但是，畢竟是為了「烹飪修行」，忍住心中對於火的恐懼，控制火候的大小，也是修行的一環。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200328,
					"content": "原來如此…也是時候回去了，蘭帕卡提還在等著你們呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200329,
					"content": "嗯。我馬上就回桓那蘭那。不然，讓重要的「妹妹」擔心，可不好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200330,
					"content": "至於那幾個傢伙…蘭薩卡、蘭阿帕斯、蘭非拉分別在<color=#00E1FFFF>化城郭附近</color>、<color=#00E1FFFF>水天叢林</color>和<color=#00E1FFFF>降諸魔山</color>。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200331,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們。金燦燦的那菈{NICKNAME}，就如太陽般耀眼。派蒙，也有點了不起。妹妹的委託，就麻煩{F#妳}{M#你}們了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200332,
					"content": "為什麼到了我這裡就變成了「有點了不起了呀」！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200333
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200333,
					"content": "#哎呀，不要在意…總之，{F#妳}{M#你}們幫了我那麼多，我都不知道該怎麼報答{F#妳}{M#你}們…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200334
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200334,
					"content": "#嗯，我決定將「至上珍饈」的做法教給二位。或許將來，長大以後，{F#妳}{M#你}們能明白個中滋味吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200335
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200335,
					"content": "#（{NICKNAME}，這個食譜，讓我調整一下吧…應該有辦法變成不錯的原創料理！）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200314,
					"content": "至少沒有毒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200316
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200315,
					"content": "這種滋味對我來說或許有點太前衛了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200316
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7302004,
			"completionStepIds": [],
