			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"蘭茶荼"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730200401,
					"content": "採到了「一頭菇」，完成了烹飪修行，認識了高大又可靠的那菈。真是開心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200402,
					"content": "#蘭帕卡提、蘭薩卡、蘭阿帕斯、蘭非拉一定也會感謝{F#妳}{M#你}的。那菈{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}是個好那菈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				},
				{
					"id": 730200403,
					"content": "感謝我？為什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730200404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730200404,
					"content": "當然是因為，藉由幫助我，給了他們品嚐「一頭菇」的機會。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭茶荼"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7302005,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
